WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Building trust in Nigeria's food chain. GroChain connects farmers, buyers, and agencies.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Farmers log harvest details — crop, grade, and location — each batch gets a unique ID.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.500
Every batch receives a QR code. Buyers scan to verify origin and farmer details.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:19.500
List on the marketplace, accept payments, and track shipments on one platform.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.500
Ready to get started? Join farmers, buyers, and partner agencies on GroChain.
